Regional Outlook
Asia-Pacific dominates the market and accounted for approximately 55% of global sales in 2025.
China, India, Japan, South Korea and Southeast Asia represent important manufacturing and consumption markets.
North America remains an important destination for industrial, agricultural and specialized high-performance applications.
Europe maintains demand through industrial textiles, automotive applications and technical fibers.
Emerging markets are creating additional opportunities through infrastructure development and agricultural modernization.
